# macOS SwiftUI GUI — the Xcode project is generated by xcodegen (project.yml),
# so don't track it or any Xcode build/user state. The sources under mac-gui/
# (*.swift, *.mm, *.h, *.hpp, project.yml, SETUP.md) ARE tracked.
mac-gui/*.xcodeproj
mac-gui/**/xcuserdata/
mac-gui/**/*.xcuserstate
mac-gui/**/xcshareddata/
mac-gui/DerivedData/
mac-gui/build/
mac-gui/.build/

